      "cautions": [
        "To start, sit with the dumbbells on the thighs and roll back, bringing them to the chest; reverse this to finish (clinical opinion).",
        "Keep the wrists straight over the forearms; the arm holding overhead must stay stacked over the shoulder.",
        "Stop if sharp pain, numbness or tingling occurs.",
        "Muscle glow colours and activation curves are illustrative, not measured EMG."
      ],
      "modify": [
        "Shoulder discomfort: tuck the elbows more."
